        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>数学试题解析</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  },\n  svg: { fontCache: 'global' }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-svg.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", \"Noto Serif CJK SC\", serif;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 19px 36px 0 53px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    background: #fff;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.52;\n  }\n  p {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  .indent {\n    padding-left: 4px;\n  }\n  .answer {\n    color: #8c3e31;\n  }\n  .analysis-label {\n    color: #243b45;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .formula-line {\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .top-gap {\n    height: 2px;\n  }\n  .q19 {\n    position: relative;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n  }\n  .q19-heading {\n    color: #222;\n    margin-left: -17px;\n  }\n  .q19-text {\n    width: 327px;\n  }\n  .q19-solution {\n    width: 330px;\n  }\n  .diagram {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 0;\n    width: 137px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n  .diagram-one {\n    top: 0;\n    height: 132px;\n  }\n  .diagram-two {\n    top: 151px;\n    height: 145px;\n  }\n  .diagram svg {\n    display: block;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n  }\n  .diagram-caption {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 2px;\n    bottom: 0;\n    font-size: 7px;\n    color: transparent;\n  }\n  .q20 {\n    margin-top: 5px;\n    margin-left: -17px;\n    border-top: 1px solid #777;\n    padding-top: 4px;\n    width: 470px;\n  }\n  .q20-text {\n    margin-left: 17px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  mjx-container {\n    margin: 0 !important;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <p>记 $\\triangle ABC$ 的内角 $A,B,C$ 的对边分别为 $a,b,c,$ 已知\n    $\\dfrac{\\cos A}{1+\\sin A}=\\dfrac{\\sin2B}{1+\\cos2B}$．\n  </p>\n  <p>（1）若 $C=\\dfrac{2\\pi}{3}$，求 $B$；</p>\n  <p>（2）求 $\\dfrac{a^2+b^2}{c^2}$ 的最小值．</p>\n\n  <div class=\"top-gap\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"answer\">\n    <p class=\"formula-line\"><span class=\"analysis-label\">【解析】</span>\n      $\\dfrac{\\sin2B}{1+\\cos2B}\n      =\\dfrac{2\\sin B\\cos B}{2\\cos^2B}\n      =\\dfrac{\\sin B}{\\cos B}\n      =\\dfrac{\\cos A}{1+\\sin A}$\n    </p>\n    <p>$\\Rightarrow \\sin B+\\sin B\\sin A=\\cos B\\cos A$</p>\n    <p>$\\Rightarrow \\sin B=\\cos B\\cos A-\\sin B\\sin A=\\cos(B+A)=-\\cos C$</p>\n    <p>$\\because B,C\\in(0,\\pi),\\ \\therefore \\sin B&gt;0\\Rightarrow\\cos C&lt;0,\\ C&gt;\\dfrac{\\pi}{2};\\quad B\\in(0,\\dfrac{\\pi}{2})$．</p>\n    <p>$\\sin B=\\sin(C-\\dfrac{\\pi}{2})\\Rightarrow B=C-\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}$ 或 $B+C-\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}=\\pi$（舍）</p>\n    <p>（1）$B=C-\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}=\\dfrac{\\pi}{6}$</p>\n    <p>（2）因为我们有角的关系，我们将边化为角：$A=\\pi-B-C=\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}-2B;\\ C=\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}+B$</p>\n    <p class=\"formula-line\">由正弦定理：\n      $\\dfrac{a^2+b^2}{c^2}\n      =\\dfrac{\\sin^2A+\\sin^2B}{\\sin^2C}\n      =\\dfrac{\\cos^22B+\\sin^2B}{\\cos^2B}\n      =\\dfrac{(2\\cos^2B-1)^2+1-\\cos^2B}{\\cos^2B}$\n    </p>\n    <p>令 $x=\\cos^2B,\\ x\\in(0,1)$</p>\n    <p class=\"formula-line\">\n      $\\dfrac{a^2+b^2}{c^2}\n      =\\dfrac{(2x-1)^2+1-x}{x}\n      =\\dfrac{4x^2-5x+2}{x}\n      =4x+\\dfrac{2}{x}-5\n      \\geqslant2\\sqrt8-5=4\\sqrt2-5$\n    </p>\n    <p>$4x=\\dfrac{2}{x}\\Rightarrow x=\\dfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}$ 时取等号</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"q19\">\n    <p class=\"q19-heading\">19.（12分）</p>\n\n    <div class=\"diagram diagram-one placeholder\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 137 132\" aria-label=\"三棱柱示意图\">\n        <g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\">\n          <path d=\"M19 14 L120 14 L120 87 L69 119 L19 91 Z\"/>\n          <path d=\"M19 14 L69 119\"/>\n          <path d=\"M19 14 L59 56 L120 14\"/>\n          <path d=\"M59 56 L69 119\"/>\n          <path d=\"M59 56 L120 87\"/>\n          <path d=\"M19 91 L120 87\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\"/>\n          <path d=\"M19 14 L120 87\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\"/>\n          <path d=\"M69 119 L120 14\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\"/>\n        </g>\n        <g font-family=\"Times New Roman, serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#222\">\n          <text x=\"6\" y=\"14\">A</text>\n          <text x=\"123\" y=\"16\">C₁</text>\n          <text x=\"50\" y=\"58\">B₁</text>\n          <text x=\"72\" y=\"55\">D</text>\n          <text x=\"67\" y=\"130\">B</text>\n          <text x=\"123\" y=\"91\">C</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n      <span class=\"diagram-caption\">[Diagram: top-right triangular prism]</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"diagram diagram-two placeholder\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 137 145\" aria-label=\"三棱柱及辅助线示意图\">\n        <g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"0.8\">\n          <path d=\"M18 13 L120 13 L120 91 L69 124 L18 93 Z\"/>\n          <path d=\"M18 13 L69 124\"/>\n          <path d=\"M18 13 L58 56 L120 13\"/>\n          <path d=\"M58 56 L69 124\"/>\n          <path d=\"M58 56 L120 91\"/>\n          <path d=\"M18 93 L120 91\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\"/>\n          <path d=\"M18 13 L120 91\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\"/>\n          <path d=\"M69 124 L120 13\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\"/>\n          <path d=\"M38 73 L75 83\"/>\n          <path d=\"M38 73 L69 124\"/>\n          <path d=\"M38 73 L58 56\"/>\n          <path d=\"M75 83 L58 56\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\"/>\n          <path d=\"M75 83 L69 124\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\"/>\n          <path d=\"M31 83 Q35 74 43 71\"/>\n          <path d=\"M34 86 Q41 79 48 78\"/>\n        </g>\n        <g font-family=\"Times New Roman, serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#222\">\n          <text x=\"5\" y=\"13\">A</text>\n          <text x=\"123\" y=\"15\">C₁</text>\n          <text x=\"49\" y=\"57\">B₁</text>\n          <text x=\"75\" y=\"56\">D</text>\n          <text x=\"22\" y=\"76\">M</text>\n          <text x=\"76\" y=\"87\">N</text>\n          <text x=\"68\" y=\"136\">B</text>\n          <text x=\"123\" y=\"95\">C</text>\n          <text x=\"25\" y=\"91\">A₁</text>\n          <text x=\"105\" y=\"111\">2</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n      <span class=\"diagram-caption\">[Diagram: bottom-right triangular prism with auxiliary lines]</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"q19-text\">\n      <p>如图，直三棱柱 $ABC-A_1B_1C_1$ 的体积为 $4$，$\\triangle ABC$ 的面积为 $2\\sqrt2$．</p>\n      <p>（1）求 $A_1$ 到平面 $ABC$ 的距离；</p>\n      <p>（2）设 $D$ 为棱 $CC_1$ 的中点，$AA_1=AB$，平面 $A_1BC\\perp$ 平面 $ABB_1A_1$，求二面角 $A-BD-C$ 的正弦值．</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"answer q19-solution\">\n      <p><span class=\"analysis-label\">【解析】</span>（1）等体积法：设 $A_1$ 到平面 $ABC$ 的距离为 $h$</p>\n      <p>$V_{A_1-ABC}=V_{A_1-ABCC_1}=\\dfrac13\\cdot4=\\dfrac13S_{\\triangle ABC}\\cdot h\\Rightarrow h=\\sqrt2$</p>\n      <p>（2）大家应该都能看出 $BC\\perp$ 面 $ABB_1A_1$，但就是很多人没证出来。</p>\n      <p>建系的这个说明是必要的。取 $A_1B$ 中点 $M$，连 $MD$</p>\n      <p>$AA_1=AB$，$AA_1\\perp AB\\Rightarrow AM\\perp A_1B$，又平面 $A_1BC\\perp$ 平面 $ABB_1A_1$</p>\n      <p>$A_1B\\subset$ 平面 $A_1BC$，且 $A_1B$ 为交线 $\\Rightarrow AM\\perp$ 面 $A_1BC$，$BC\\subset$ 面 $A_1BC$</p>\n      <p>$\\Rightarrow BC\\perp AM$，又 $BC\\perp AA_1\\Rightarrow BC\\perp$ 面 $ABB_1A_1\\Rightarrow BC\\perp AB$（省略了一点步骤，大家考</p>\n      <p>虑中不难看懂）</p>\n      <p>作 $MN\\perp BD$，连 $AN$，易证 $\\angle MNA$ 即为 $A-BD-A_1$ 的平面角，也</p>\n      <p>是二面角 $A-BD-C$ 的补角，而该角为钝角</p>\n      <p>图中各关系都易求，$BD=\\sqrt3$，等面积法求 $MN=\\dfrac{\\sqrt2}{\\sqrt3}$，$AN=\\dfrac{2\\sqrt2}{\\sqrt3}$</p>\n      <p>$\\sin\\angle MNA=\\dfrac{AM}{AN}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}$</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"q20\">\n    <p>20.（12分）</p>\n    <p class=\"q20-text\">一医疗团队为研究某地的一种地方性疾病与当地居民的卫生习惯（卫生</p>\n  </section>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
      },
